---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | TendersMW"
  description="TendersMW disclaimer — important information about our tender aggregation service."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-6">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="glass-card p-6 space-y-6 text-sm text-muted">

      <div class="bg-red-900/30 border border-red-500/40 rounded-lg p-4">
        <p class="text-text font-bold mb-2">Important Notice</p>
        <p>TendersMW is an independent, privately operated tender aggregation service. We are <strong class="text-text">not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to</strong> the Government of Malawi, the Public Procurement and Disposal of Assets Authority (PPDA), MANEPS, the World Bank, African Development Bank, European Union, United Nations, or any procuring entity whose tenders appear on this platform.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">No Official Authority</h2>
      <p>TendersMW does not issue, award, or manage tenders. We aggregate publicly available procurement notices from third-party sources for informational convenience only. Listings on this site do not constitute official government publications and should not be treated as such.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">No Guarantee of Accuracy</h2>
      <p>While we use automated systems to collect tender information from public sources, <strong class="text-text">we cannot and do not guarantee</strong> the accuracy, completeness, timeliness, or authenticity of any listing. Information may be outdated, incomplete, incorrectly categorised, or contain errors introduced during the automated collection process.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Always Verify With the Procuring Entity</h2>
      <p class="text-text font-medium">Before taking any action based on a listing on this site, you must:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
        <li><strong class="text-text">Contact the procuring entity directly</strong> to confirm the tender exists and is currently open</li>
        <li><strong class="text-text">Obtain official tender documents</strong> from the procuring entity or the official publication platform (PPDA, MANEPS, donor agency website)</li>
        <li><strong class="text-text">Verify all dates, requirements, and submission procedures</strong> with the issuing authority</li>
        <li><strong class="text-text">Do not rely solely on TendersMW</strong> for any procurement decision</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>TendersMW, its owners, operators, and affiliates accept <strong class="text-text">no responsibility or liability whatsoever</strong> for any loss, damage, cost, or expense — whether direct, indirect, consequential, or otherwise — arising from the use of or reliance on any information published on this website. This includes, without limitation, losses arising from:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
        <li>Inaccurate, incomplete, or outdated tender information</li>
        <li>Listings that do not correspond to actual published tenders</li>
        <li>Missed deadlines or submission requirements</li>
        <li>Any business decisions made based on information found on this site</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Data Sources</h2>
      <p>Tender information is collected from the following public sources using automated web scraping:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
        <li>Malawi Revenue Authority (MRA) — <a href="https://www.mra.mw/tenders" class="text-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mra.mw/tenders</a></li>
        <li>Electricity Supply Corporation of Malawi (ESCOM) — <a href="https://www.escom.mw/tenders/" class="text-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">escom.mw/tenders</a></li>
        <li>Public Procurement and Disposal of Assets Authority (PPDA) — <a href="https://www.ppda.mw/tenders" class="text-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ppda.mw/tenders</a></li>
        <li>EU Tenders Electronic Daily (TED) — <a href="https://ted.europa.eu" class="text-accent hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ted.europa.eu</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2">For authoritative and official tender information, please visit these sources directly.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">Contact</h2>
      <p>If you believe a listing on this site is inaccurate or should be removed, please contact us and we will take immediate action.</p>

      <p class="text-xs text-muted/60 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">Last updated: May 2026</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
